        >
          The click target already extends to the label. Don’t override the
          {@render roundedCode("<label>")}/{@render roundedCode("htmlFor")} association
          with a custom wrapper that breaks the click region.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </Row>
{/snippet}

